OL,5,G0905 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThere's a blistering pursuit on
OL,7,     Fthe M1 as Interceptors chase a
OL,8,     Fvehicle veering across lanes,
OL,9,     Fpushing the speed to 115mph. And
OL,10,     Fwe follow the dog unit as three
OL,11,     Fcanine cops are trained.
OL,12,G1005 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FCops seeking a suspect fleeing on
OL,14,     Ffoot, apprehend their suspect
OL,15,     Fthanks to their German Shepherd.
OL,16,     FAnd a gang picks the wrong time
OL,17,     Fand place for a burglary: a local
OL,18,     Fpolice training area.
